  "title": {
    "type": "text",
    "$t": "台灣人寫真 - 阿姑是公親tsiânn"
  },
  "content": {
    "type": "html",
    "$t": "<p>&nbsp;</p><p></p><h1 style=\"text-align: center;\"><span style=\"font-size: x-large;\">《阿姑是公親tsiânn》</span><span style=\"font-size: large;\">/</span><span style=\"font-size: medium;\">巫素宜</span></h1><div style=\"text-align: center;\"><a href=\"https://blogger.googleusercontent.com/img/a/AVvXsEhUyTaBAZsjus1CbC28-iJ9Ug1xIOgd2zq66E6mCckuyMZlnJWEar3YmBaNulgpWeCvHn4ZNwezpdSZMh26XQPJHN-7w0G1p6-fbTSBtroua0U57_shR0H_pg5HNvY2ARlZUT32103z1R8xOFcq_o19QOQ0IdkniYTRPNUwaNgAUCsSoztktpPeDN7AXHo4\" style=\"margin-left: 1em; margin-right: 1em;\"><img data-original-height=\"729\" data-original-width=\"516\" height=\"640\" src=\"https://blogger.googleusercontent.com/img/a/AVvXsEhUyTaBAZsjus1CbC28-iJ9Ug1xIOgd2zq66E6mCckuyMZlnJWEar3YmBaNulgpWeCvHn4ZNwezpdSZMh26XQPJHN-7w0G1p6-fbTSBtroua0U57_shR0H_pg5HNvY2ARlZUT32103z1R8xOFcq_o19QOQ0IdkniYTRPNUwaNgAUCsSoztktpPeDN7AXHo4=w453-h640\" width=\"453\" /></a><a href=\"https://blogger.googleusercontent.com/img/a/AVvXsEjGXHQnvdk9RoTFKGE3eRVa2FMbaH6YcMYWITFoIlOEM0_SHJguv1_sp2zwXWWbp6LY8epHa8jEqdXK2a600jAC5ruUginIeZfo8OUHKbboneRqaljg6x8R3_ZbEjne1Xg-Xl-DwVTlj7dvnYTxflP5gF24X4SR5zgp-Ol5AJ-dX8d8HuN7FGutg76rU4du\" style=\"font-size: xx-large; margin-left: 1em; margin-right: 1em;\"><img data-original-height=\"3038\" data-original-width=\"2150\" height=\"640\" src=\"https://blogger.googleusercontent.com/img/a/AVvXsEjGXHQnvdk9RoTFKGE3eRVa2FMbaH6YcMYWITFoIlOEM0_SHJguv1_sp2zwXWWbp6LY8epHa8jEqdXK2a600jAC5ruUginIeZfo8OUHKbboneRqaljg6x8R3_ZbEjne1Xg-Xl-DwVTlj7dvnYTxflP5gF24X4SR5zgp-Ol5AJ-dX8d8HuN7FGutg76rU4du=w453-h640\" width=\"453\" /></a></div><div><span><div class=\"separator\" style=\"clear: both; font-size: xx-large; text-align: center;\"><br /></div><div><div><div><span style=\"font-family: arial; font-size: medium;\">結婚了後，原本kah ta-ke-kuann蹛做伙，m̄-koh厝--裡koh有大伯仔kah小叔仔，落尾大伯仔mā結婚--ah，總--是感覺樹大pun-ue，人大pun家，所以我就提出beh買家己ê厝ê想法。Tshím開始，阮翁是無想beh beh--ê，伊感覺kah爸母蹛做伙tsiânn好，囡仔有人tshuā，下班有人煮飯煮便便，摸蜊仔兼洗褲——一兼二顧，搬--出-去kám有khah好？</span></div><div><span style=\"font-family: arial; font-size: medium;\"><br /></span></div><div><span style=\"font-family: arial; font-size: medium;\">我就開始tī阮翁ê耳空邊逐工kā伊洗腦：「買厝是不動產，錢iáu無khai--去，算是投資。」「啥人講有孝爸母就ài lóng蹛tī身軀邊？Lán ē-tàng買tī離爸母ê厝khah近ê所在，beh tńg來看爸母iah是講序大人想beh家己來lán兜mā ē-sái ê距離，一支鎖匙hōo--in，in mā ē-tàng家己來。」「Ài趁tsit-má kah ta-ke-kuann ê關係iáu真好，緊搬--出-來，m̄-thang等逐家看對方lóng變tsha̍k目ê時，tsiah beh來搬，án-ne就siunn慢--ah，逐家就歹看面--looh！上好是雙方lóng停留tī美好ê印象。」「你是後生，kah家己ê序大人有無歡喜ê所在，講hōo清楚就準拄煞，船過水無痕；m̄-koh新婦就無仝--ah，khioh恨囥tī心肝內，án-ne我m̄是按怎做lóng了gōng工？」</span></div><div><span style=\"font-family: arial; font-size: medium;\"><br /></span></div><div><span style=\"font-family: arial; font-size: medium;\">聽我án-ne講，阮翁mā感覺有道理（洗腦成功！），所以阮就買家己ê厝--looh。後頭厝ê大兄in大漢後生拄好考tiâu高雄ê大學，我tsit个阿姑，koh有家己ê厝便便，當然mā是叫伊來阮兜蹛就好，m̄免tī外口稅厝。蹛tī家己阿姑ê厝是包蹛koh包食，雖然kah姪仔差十出頭歲niā-niā，suah感覺ná家己ê後生仝款，讀冊beh買電腦，tsit个阿姑mā是無第二句話，錢隨提hōo伊去買。</span></div><div><span style=\"font-family: arial; font-size: medium;\"><br /></span></div><div><span style=\"font-family: arial; font-size: medium;\">Suà--落-來，換伊ê小弟beh重考大學，決定beh來高雄tsit个大都市補習，我tsit个阿姑當然是攑雙跤雙手贊成，tsit聲兩个兄弟仔lóng蹛tī阿姑tsia。小弟來tsia補習，無交通工具，ná無跤仝款，想beh買oo-tóo-bái suah無夠錢，姑丈a̍t-sá-lih一句話「欠偌濟？」五萬箍隨領hōo伊去買機車。蹛一冬，考tiâu大學了後，就去中部ê大學讀冊--ah。Tsit个阿兄四冬大學讀煞，koh做一年十個月ê阿兵哥，做煞了後，因為決定beh留tī高雄發展，就繼續蹛tī tsit个阿姑tsia到伊結婚tsiah搬走。</span></div><div><span style=\"font-family: arial; font-size: medium;\"><br /></span></div><div><span style=\"font-family: arial; font-size: medium;\">我有三个兄哥，一个阿姊。落尾阿姊ê後生，mā考tiâu高雄ê大學，哪ē-sái叫阿姑--ê ē-tàng來蹛，叫阿姨--ê就bē-tàng來！Án-ne我應該ē hōo阮阿姊怨--死。就án-ne，前前後後十外年ê時間，照顧蹛tī tsia ê三个姪仔kah外甥仔。</span></div><div><span style=\"font-family: arial; font-size: medium;\"><br /></span></div><div><span style=\"font-family: arial; font-size: medium;\">Tsit幾年ê時間，我tsiânn感謝我ê翁婿，伊m̄ bat講過一聲怨嘆ê話，mā m̄ bat講過我顧外家tsit款話，bē kā我講lán家己有兩个囡仔ài飼，koh leh照顧兄弟姊妹ê囡仔，我其實知影tsiok濟人lóng有tsit款嫁--人就bē-tàng顧後頭厝ê觀念，m̄-koh阮翁顛倒kā我講：「姑疼孫，是仝字姓；姨疼甥，是差一字柄；妗疼甥，是ènn-ènn-tènn。」</span></div><div><span style=\"font-family: arial; font-size: medium;\"><br /></span></div><div><span style=\"font-family: arial; font-size: medium;\">Tsit種leh講姑姨kah姪甥關係ê俗語，我第一擺聽--著，就是按伊ê喙--裡聽--著--ê。伊講我ē想beh照顧孫仔，是tsiânn正常ê代誌，伊mā感覺合理。好佳哉伊是「九个人，十塊粿——有冗（有量）」，koh ē kah我做伙照顧tsia-ê孫仔，tsit種翁婿，點燈火mā無tè揣，真正m̄是我家己leh褒。</span></div><div><span style=\"font-family: arial; font-size: medium;\"><br /></span></div><div><span style=\"font-family: arial; font-size: medium;\">Tsit-má，bat tī我tsia蹛--過ê孫仔，各人lóng有各人ê家庭，mā lóng做老爸--ah。阮阿爸kā我講：「阿姑是公親tsiânn，另工，我若是百歲年老--ah，看啥人beh叫你去食飯？疼tsia-ê孫仔，哪有啥mih路用？」</span></div><div><span style=\"font-family: arial; font-size: medium;\"><br /></span></div><div><span style=\"font-family: arial; font-size: medium;\">以早，我m̄ bat聽過「阿姑是公親tsiann」tsit種講法，想想--leh，tsit句話koh不止仔心適，確實是大房、二房、三房ê阿姑，我kā阿爸講：「M̄免緊張，我tsit个小妹tsiah-nī仔好，我m̄信in ē án-ne對待--我。而且，我照顧tsia-ê姪仔外甥仔，m̄是beh討人情。人講 “歡喜做，甘願受”。」M̄-thang想想hiah濟，日子khah快活--lah！</span></div></div></div><div><span style=\"font-family: arial; font-size: medium;\"><br /></span></div><div><span style=\"font-family: arial; font-size: medium;\"><br /></span></div><div><span style=\"font-family: arial; font-size: medium;\"><h2 style=\"font-family: &quot;Times New Roman&quot;; text-align: center;\"><div style=\"font-size: medium; font-weight: 400; text-align: left;\"><span style=\"font-family: arial; font-size: medium;\"><div class=\"separator\" style=\"clear: both; text-align: center;\"><div class=\"separator\" style=\"clear: both;\"><div style=\"font-family: &quot;Times New Roman&quot;; font-size: medium; text-align: left;\"><span><div style=\"text-align: center;\"><span style=\"font-family: arial; font-size: medium;\"><div class=\"separator\" style=\"clear: both;\"><div class=\"separator\" style=\"clear: both;\"><a href=\"https://blogger.googleusercontent.com/img/a/AVvXsEi10RzPL1r0HYReHsGye0eDuRyBKDCLJ57vMqDHjPrnDx_EWJp4Cn2qS-4oj_eZsSxDSjLcalOOcubtFCahnMprqZSSeYamKS7-SCD3aWHUQuLp7Z3rFgVXRkEcyd0vdxaBFCIpIK-VBPjLRjeNNkMr9e_6-3GRcxGZvEKqFK1s4pJHyVMwMXimScyOrPqQ\" style=\"margin-left: 1em; margin-right: 1em;\"><img data-original-height=\"3035\" data-original-width=\"2129\" height=\"640\" src=\"https://blogger.googleusercontent.com/img/a/AVvXsEi10RzPL1r0HYReHsGye0eDuRyBKDCLJ57vMqDHjPrnDx_EWJp4Cn2qS-4oj_eZsSxDSjLcalOOcubtFCahnMprqZSSeYamKS7-SCD3aWHUQuLp7Z3rFgVXRkEcyd0vdxaBFCIpIK-VBPjLRjeNNkMr9e_6-3GRcxGZvEKqFK1s4pJHyVMwMXimScyOrPqQ=w448-h640\" width=\"448\" /></a></div><div class=\"separator\" style=\"clear: both;\"><br /></div><div class=\"separator\" style=\"clear: both;\"><div class=\"separator\" style=\"background-color: white; clear: both; color: #444444; font-family: Arial, Tahoma, Helvetica, FreeSans, sans-serif; font-size: 13px;\"><div class=\"separator\" style=\"clear: both;\"><span style=\"color: #38761d; font-size: medium;\"><b><span style=\"font-family: inherit; text-align: left; white-space-collapse: preserve;\"><a class=\"oajrlxb2 g5ia77u1 qu0x051f esr5mh6w e9989ue4 r7d6kgcz rq0escxv nhd2j8a9 nc684nl6 p7hjln8o kvgmc6g5 cxmmr5t8 oygrvhab hcukyx3x jb3vyjys rz4wbd8a qt6c0cv9 a8nywdso i1ao9s8h esuyzwwr f1sip0of lzcic4wl gpro0wi8 q66pz984 b1v8xokw\" href=\"https://www.facebook.com/hashtag/%E5%8F%B0%E6%96%87%E9%80%9A%E8%A8%8Abong%E5%A0%B1?__eep__=6&amp;__cft__[0]=AZWDjUJsSxaPbx9rBf3emvc0qX31sZFFUgNNqOtI9vv64OwqXsGEcwI3lw-EjolqeunKDULXB2AzmrXPdDewdlrZi72lKhnFv6ZPAhhxYvK8KMzXeD-ekv7Y_z6BLYVkK4MlRank2JL7XQR1R13adh_SDiIvZcpr6jdEpFHPKpL2oc7EsEvYcOny0uZTPG13xlE&amp;__tn__=*NK-R\" role=\"link\" style=\"-webkit-tap-highlight-color: transparent; background-color: transparent; border-color: initial; border-style: initial; border-width: 0px; box-sizing: border-box; color: #3778cd; cursor: pointer; display: inline; font-family: inherit; list-style: none; margin: 0px; outline: none; padding: 0px; text-align: inherit; text-decoration-line: none; touch-action: manipulation;\" tabindex=\"0\">#台文通訊BONG報</a></span><span face=\"&quot;Segoe UI Historic&quot;, &quot;Segoe UI&quot;, Helvetica, Arial, sans-serif\" style=\"text-align: left; white-space-collapse: preserve;\"> 380期，202